netease-music-linux (1.3.5-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Support Qt 5.12 syntax and signal handlers on older Linux desktops.
  * Keep search, navigation, playlist details, and back navigation working.
  * Convert cached PNG covers to JPEG for Qt 5.12 image decoding.
  * Build with debhelper compat 12 and Pillow 7 from Kylin Linux 10.1.
  * Open a playlist author from the card and the playlist page.
  * Refresh the play bar less often so scrolling stays smooth.
  * Drag the window from the pointer instead of a moving global coordinate.
  * Keep only the visible search and playlist rows in memory.
  * Give album, artist, and playlist introductions their own background.

 -- Shang Xiaoyang <shangxiaoyang@kylinos.cn>  Fri, 30 Oct 2026 18:40:00 +0800

