netease-music-linux (1.3.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Remember downloads, and explain an empty download page.
  * Search songs by default, and load playlists only from their own tab.
  * Open a playlist page with play, play-next, and collect.
  * Rename, delete, or unsubscribe a sidebar playlist, and queue the whole list.
  * Resume a long pause on the same song instead of skipping ahead.
  * Keep the search box off the account name.
  * Theme the playlist actions, and close volume and quality popups on a blank click.
  * Cap cover downloads, and ignore a late song search after switching to playlists.

